full path: UiTextures::get() looks a name up relative to the WAD folders,
and the absolute path 0013 passed was never found there, so every such
texture (the HUD's panels: player frame, ability bar, shop) "did not
load". The first loaded ones and the misses, with the reason, to stderr.

